    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho olwatuuka, bwe yali ng'ayemereire ku mbali kw'enhandha Gennesareti, abantu nga bali kumwenhigirizaaku abaali benda okuwulira ekibono kya Katonda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.13.1+MAT.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 13:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.3.9+MRK.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 3:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaabona amaato abiri ku bukalu aye ng'abavubi bagaviiremu nga bali kwamula obutimba bwaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaniina mu lyato irala, erya Simoni, yaamukoba aliseeseeyooku katono okuva ku bukalu, yaatyama yaayegeresa abantu ng'ali mu lyato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala okwogera, yaakoba Simoni ati: “Twala eryato ere mu maadhi amangi, mutege obutimba bwaimwe mugemye ebyenhandha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni yaamwiramu ati: “Musengwa twafaabiikaine obwire bwonabwona ghazira kye twagemiisa. Aye olw'ekibono kyo ndidha kutega obutimba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoa 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baakola ekyo baagemya ebyenhandha kamaala n'obutimba bwayenda kukanuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoa 21:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaghemya bavubi banaibwe ab'eryato erindi baidhe bababeereku. Baidha baidhuza amaato gombi gaayenda na kudimira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero bwe yabona atyo yaagwa ku bikiryaivu bya Yesu yaamukoba ati: “Musengwa ndeka kuba nze ndi mwonooni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Petero ni boonaboona be yali nabo baali mu kwewuunhia kungi olw'ebyenhandha kamaala bityo bye baagemya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu nsambo n'endala Yakobo ni Yoanne abaana ba Zebedaayo baine ba Simoni boona baayasaamirira. Yesu yaakoba Simoni ati: “Otatya, okuva ni mperaano oidha kuba muvubi wa bantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olwatuusa amaato ku bukalu baaleka byonabyona baamunonereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwatuuka Yesu bwe yali ali mu kibuga kirala, ghaabaagho omusaadha nga alwaire endwaire ey'ebigenge. Bwe yabona Yesu, yeeyala ku itaka, yaamweghemba ng'akoba ati: “Musengwa, bw'oyenda, oghanga okumponia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaagolola omukono yaamugemaku yaakoba ati: “Nhenda, wona!” Era mangu ago ng'endwaire ey'ebigenge emuleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamusikirira obutakoberaku muntu yeenayeena, aye aje yeeyandhule ye kabona, agheeyo ekirabo olw'okuwona kwe, nga Musa bwe yalagira, ng'okwo kwe bali n'okukakalisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ebimufaaku byayongera kusansaana, era abantu kamaala beesoloza okumuwulirisa n'okuwonezebwa ebibaluma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yesu yaabavangaku yaaja eyo ezira bantu yaasaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwali lulala, Yesu yali ayegeresa, era ng'ali n'amaani ga Musengwa ag'okuwonia. Abafarisaayo n'Abanamateeka abaali baviire mu buli kyalo: abaava e Galilaaya, mu Buyudaaya, ni mu Yerusalemu nga batyaime agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaidhagho abasaadha nga basitwire omuntu ku ndiri, nga yagogoma. Baayenda bamusitule bamungize bamumute mu maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe baalemwa okufuna engeri ey'okumusitula okumwingiza olw'eikuukuubira ery'abantu, baaniina ghaigulu ku ndhu, baatoolaghooku obutegula, baamwisiza agho n'endiri ye, baamuta ghagati mu maiso ga Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu bwe yabona okwikiriza kwaibwe yaakoba ati: “Musaadha iwe, osoniyiibwa ebibi byo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanamateeka n'Abafarisaayo baatoolera okwebuuza nga bakoba bati: “Ono naani ayogera ebivuma Katonda? Naani aghanga okusonigha ebibi okutoolaku Katonda yenka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yesu yaamanha ebidhuubo byaibwe, yaakoba ati: “Lwaki mudhuuba mutyo mu myoyo gyaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiki ekisinga obwangu, okukoba nti, ‘Ebibi byo bikusoniyiibwa,’ oba nti, ‘Situka otambule’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ka mumanhe muti Omwana w'Omuntu ali n'obukumu ku nsi okusonigha ebibi.” Agho yaakoba omugogomu ati: “Nkoba iwe, situka ogeme endiri yo oje ewaimwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ng'asitukiramu omulundi mulala nga balingiriire, ng'agema ndiri kwe yali alambaire, ng'agolola ewuwe nga bw'asaaka Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boonaboona baayasaamirira, baasaaka Katonda, era nga baidhwire okutya baakoba bati: “Olwaleero tuboine ebinene!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo olwawa, yaavaagho yaaja, yaabona omughooza ow'omusolo ng'eriina lye ni Levi, ng'atyaime agho ghe bawooleza, yaamukoba ati: “Nnonereza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaleka byonabyona yaasituka yaamunonereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Levi oyo yaamukolera embaga ey'amaani mu ndhu ye. Era abaghooza kamaala n'abantu abandi abaaligho yaalya nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Abafarisaayo n'Abanamateeka baibwe beemuluguunhia, baakoba Abeegeresebwa be bati: “Lwaki mulya era ni munhwa n'abaghooza n'aboonooni?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
